;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Next Tokyo 運営事務局&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-80d02c94-7fff-1841-29fe-726650c061f7&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 11pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;E-mail: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:gc-nexttokyo-info@google.com&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 11pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;gc-nexttokyo-info@google.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</description><link>https://developers-jp.googleblog.com/2026/06/next-tokyo-expo.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (DevRelJP)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg3xPJxvBhJ6L_BnCAPic7HMFXyzV59-tnioKo9h64CCJ9ZCgllrU_wLgemem4obIDHWEbDjr5Q_9FfBrzSnpmUk_jC4UTHYn0LITT9o9oivkk_Th6qjnzBkna6dTeWD_GUMG0sj_EkFioUlsrpwG9LTHEwXc2I1AqOH1BZXLdIM7eSex0F_Z3NB31l2KQ/s72-w640-h316-c/image11.png" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total><georss:featurename>Tokyo, Japan</georss:featurename><georss:point>35.6764225 139.650027</georss:point><georss:box>7.3661886638211556 104.493777 63.986656336178847 174.806277</georss:box></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-3051809989378612637.post-1416031073835060805</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-06-19T09:00:00.210+09:00</atom:updated><title>Google AI Dojo シーズン２　- AI ラボ・シリーズ  </title><description>&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;2026 年 7 月 18 日 - 2026 年 7 月 19 日(オンライン開催)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://services.google.com/fh/files/blogs/image.png&quot;&gt;&lt;img height=&quot;176&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjCAI8pBV9nVTiLGFEKLsP1Wo8k8bDxUyHmCfmSeVtnd0th_E3xJBuUR6HiRZKhBsu63ayi1gmonTMpl4Hf4fpJdgDZyNcp0p-ChK6xJROiM-_CtBmTUyjBYxWFibWSDW0ie5DrhMILSiRbCYv_LXlcEVKienrHZD2yncpaoqSt_pK5v9WiKDqEJ-sIBKs=w176-h176&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; border-style: none; border-width: medium; border: none; color: #444444; font-size: 9pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot; width=&quot;176&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-2ff6b616-7fff-fd12-8db8-2c567ae8a4ee&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Google AI Dojo の紹介&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Google AI Dojo は、開発者の皆様に Google AI の最新イノベーションを紹介し、既存のワークフローやアプリケーションへの統合を支援する AI ラボシリーズです。四半期ごとに開催される本プログラムです。4 月にご好評をいただいたシーズン 1 に続き、今回は待望のシーズン 2 の開催となります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;各シーズンでは、実践的な 3〜5 つのラボをご用意。AI の学習を始めたばかりの方から、さらなるスキルアップを目指す経験豊富な方まで、誰もが安心して挑戦できるよう 3 つのレベルをご提供しています。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse: collapse; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; border-style: none; border-width: medium; border: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;333&quot;&gt;&lt;/col&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;333&quot;&gt;&lt;/col&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;L100（入門）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;AI の学習を始めたばかりの方や、基礎から体系的に学びたい方に最適です。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;L200（中級）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;すでに一定の AI 開発経験があり、さらにスキルを拡張したい方向けの内容です。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;L300（上級）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border-bottom: solid #000000 1pt; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-left: solid #000000 1pt; border-right: solid #000000 1pt; border-style: solid; border-top: solid #000000 1pt; border-width: 1pt; overflow-wrap: break-word; overflow: hidden; padding: 5pt; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;実務経験豊富なプロフェッショナルを対象とした、技術を深く掘り下げる（ディープダイブ）セッションです。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;主な学習テーマ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;- 生成 AI の基礎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp; - AI エージェントの構築&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp; - AI駆動開発（Vibe Coding）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp; - Google Cloud との統合（その他多数！）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 8pt; margin-right: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin: 0pt 8pt 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #444444; font-size: 25pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;🏆&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #1f1f1f; font-size: 18pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;限定特典&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #1f1f1f; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;Google AI Dojo への参加には、エンゲージメントに応じた限定特典が用意されています。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: #1f1f1f; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; list-style-type: disc; v