white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;（事前登録不要）、進化し続ける&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;開発者コミュニティ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;のブースなど、2026 年のみなさんの開発をさらに加速させるヒントや、最新情報が満載です。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goo.gle/nx26_expo&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;オープンステージ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-c5795ba2-7fff-1cff-8294-9e551ade3fd8&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;事前登録不要のスポンサー セッション&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;です。AI エージェント、データ分析、セキュリティ、Google Workspace、Google Maps Platform などの多様なセッションを通して、Google Cloud の可能性を最大限に体感してください。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goo.gle/nx26_expo&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;認定資格 &amp;amp; ラーニング&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;クラウドの基礎から最新技術まで、あらゆるレベルに対応した多様な学びをご用意。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud 認定資格ブース&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;や&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;クイズ チャレンジ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;など、知見を深めるプログラムがあなたのキャリア更新を支えます。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goo.gle/nx26_expo&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;スポンサー ブース&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;ビジネス変革を牽引するパートナー企業が集結！生成 AI による課題解決や価値創造の最新事例を、&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;展示ブース&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;や&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;ミニステージ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;でご紹介します。確かな実績を持つ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;多様なパートナー&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;が、皆さまのビジネス課題解決と「未来への一歩」を強力にバックアップします。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13.2165pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;開催概要&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #4a86e8; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;名称：Google Cloud Next Tokyo（略称 Next Tokyo）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;日時：2026 年 7 月 30 日（木）、31 日（金）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;会場：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/xZ5bB3SC1MkYQNyc6&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;東京ビッグサイト&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; 南展示棟・会議棟&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;対象：エンジニアからビジネス リーダーまで、生成 AI やクラウドを活用して、ビジネスを次の&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;ステージへと進めたいすべての方へ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;- お問い合わせ -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Next Tokyo 運営事務局&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-right: 13pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-309aa8b9-7fff-e946-fc56-ec084244eacf&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #434343; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;E-mail:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:gc-nexttokyo-info@google.com&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;gc-nexttokyo-info@google.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</description><link>https://developers-jp.googleblog.com/2026/05/next-tokyoexpo-gemini.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (DevRelJP)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjvFzM6yX1lR1hpNznX5bwz4QToEcAhwRPbXr4Evqfnpgwz3uvLyej9VZzImmNmMJ7PoubIxJrgJocpARPE_erOXPFm2zDHgOBFf_QhShqwd_GY-XNfujgzcQ_5STFI0kMzpWk8b7S6tAK8ryRNUtkOzZBmbO8NUHsjUs6nCWM1YAR5D66Omn6RWuthA84=s72-c" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-3051809989378612637.post-1729427248522357683</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 23:50:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-04-08T08:52:07.839+09:00</atom:updated><title>【先着特典あり】Next Tokyo 登録開始！7 月 30 日、31 日 東京ビッグサイト</title><description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-c88aa84f-7fff-94c0-de30-bf2bf59c34ff&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://services.google.com/fh/files/misc/gcn26tok_blog0408.png&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;985&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1999&quot; height=&quot;339&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixOaauoCFv2iHG96t3Jw-WHLBZYkkSE5ywJbSElagNuckEWhG6v-p4eV-PNh0RWU9YPuZv-Inpi8ZFYa7UTPjtidgIXrfCLh-6lEmRu4A-RcIvp_hD1b9CBozoADiP65hKqR6yKRaDe26PwgUVwq_hIjB5jOmRxhv3KLYT4wCe8iQ02Owdr74_V-LELvE/w684-h339/20260408_1.png&quot; width=&quot;684&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;革新的なアイデアを、AI とクラウドで実現しよう&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;旗艦イベント &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-8e5caa68-7fff-a385-8729-26c49a3089e6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goo.gle/nx26_drbg2&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration-line: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #12a1e6;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud Next Tokyo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;を 2026 年 7 月 30 日（木）、 31 日（金）に東京ビッグサイト 南展示棟・会議棟にて開催します。
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: white;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://goo.gle/nx26_drbg2&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration-line: none; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Next Tokyo 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt; は、現場を支えるエンジニアと、未来を担うビジネス リーダーが主役となる舞台です。AI と Google Cloud の最先端トレンドを凝縮し、あなたの戦略を具現化するための具体的なソリューションをお届けします。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;未来を築くのは、あなた自身です。Next で得られる最先端の知見や戦略、ツールを手に、次の一歩を踏み出しましょう。革新的な&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;アイデアを現実へと変えるための、多彩な学びがここにあります。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-e480f288-7fff-b0e6-2016-252990d2d26a&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.68; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; font-size: 12pt; font-var