/search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEixOaauoCFv2iHG96t3Jw-WHLBZYkkSE5ywJbSElagNuckEWhG6v-p4eV-PNh0RWU9YPuZv-Inpi8ZFYa7UTPjtidgIXrfCLh-6lEmRu4A-RcIvp_hD1b9CBozoADiP65hKqR6yKRaDe26PwgUVwq_hIjB5jOmRxhv3KLYT4wCe8iQ02Owdr74_V-LELvE/s72-w684-h339-c/20260408_1.png" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total><georss:featurename>Tokyo, Japan</georss:featurename><georss:point>35.6764225 139.650027</georss:point><georss:box>7.3661886638211556 104.493777 63.986656336178847 174.806277</georss:box></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-3051809989378612637.post-6516742520927890766</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 06:50:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-03-18T21:55:38.436+09:00</atom:updated><title>Google AI Dojo: 最新AIスキルを習得！実践型ハンズオンプログラム 2026年第一回開催（４月２日〜）</title><description>&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-90e5c3a9-7fff-e2f7-53fe-28e6b961be23&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #303030; font-size: 10.5pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-7b0c7403-7fff-a642-8658-71f8cbddcc79&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;「Google AI Dojo」は、AIの基礎から既存アプリケーションへの統合までを実践的に学べる、デベロッパー向けのAIラボシリーズです。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;今回は4月2日〜4月6日にラボシリーズを実施し、4月17日には表彰式とLT会を開催します。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/agektmr&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/agektmr&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEia4xmMZxjjJjarhR3JcE-8TlvsaEApQlkAVYK-Y-G2EZN4dNW8gHTHDGeFqZqXUAuOnqo7bZTjg-T7xa0PuHEbtadnxRpB9ZIBoeIpzs90Fhi_Yl-yZL3UXOGDVmV3oZOzLbZ2NHDclwCZs6cb-w0_Wnhc73kVMOLwAdESQKZbMLoaKh5z9bKdRZTkZsg/s1376/20260316.png&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;768&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1376&quot; height=&quot;384&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEia4xmMZxjjJjarhR3JcE-8TlvsaEApQlkAVYK-Y-G2EZN4dNW8gHTHDGeFqZqXUAuOnqo7bZTjg-T7xa0PuHEbtadnxRpB9ZIBoeIpzs90Fhi_Yl-yZL3UXOGDVmV3oZOzLbZ2NHDclwCZs6cb-w0_Wnhc73kVMOLwAdESQKZbMLoaKh5z9bKdRZTkZsg/w685-h384/20260316.png&quot; width=&quot;685&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-3a6fa2e9-7fff-effc-84dc-004e7983b9aa&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: black; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #303030; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;🎯 Google AI Dojoのおすすめポイント&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: black; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: #303030; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;自身のスキルに合わせて学べる&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;: L100（入門）からL300（上級）まで、3つのティアでセッションをご用意しています。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: #303030; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;最先端のAIトピックを網羅&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;: 生成AIの基礎やAIエージェントの構築をはじめ、話題の「Vibe Coding（バイブ・コーディング）」をハンズオンで体験できます。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: #303030; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;参加者への特別特典&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;: 参加者全員にGoogle発行の修了証を授与します。さらに、特に活躍された方にはアワードの贈呈や、今後のGoogleイベントにご登壇いただくチャンスもご用意しています🏆！&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-62c2c059-7fff-71c4-61a3-7e31cb2b49b4&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; color: #303030; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;📅 セッションスケジュール（全日程 18:00開始）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;color: #303030; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; list-style-type: disc; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;background-color: white; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;4月2日 セッション1 (L100)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-wrap-mode: wrap; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;: Antigravityで始めるスペッ