y への移行で実現した物流データ基盤のモダナイズ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.googlecloudevents.com/next-tokyo/session-page?session_id=3130343&quot; style=&quot;text-decoration-line: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;15:00 - 15:30　&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span face=&quot;&#39;Google Sans&#39;,sans-serif&quot; style=&quot;color: #12a1e6; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;：Agent Development Kit による商品検索 AI エージェント開発&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgVDdPVl3hOKrLCH_W4nIXkHOeI94h-gr2sYHhmhdoBksYoMSLjRSaVEse_wZsIFNrRlvGUHAgbO8R6vzkcncqEbyzwnLBXw6DNY2NsZp0BIXZQKaU2JOJ4TWEVrAmDhsikB_3qmf6fQ72kAHR4BjthLnRCMrID5VJLCMxGZBtFCNmkTAGW94HZqRJmitQ/s1000/dev-d1-3.png&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;721&quot; data-original-width=&quot;1000&quot; height=&quot;231&quot; src=&q